{"id":"cd6815db60d4efdb","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-hornpurechar.md","title":"Pure Horn characterization","display":"thm-hornpurechar — Pure Horn characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-hornpurechar","aliases":["27-thm-hornpurechar"],"display":"thm-hornpurechar — Pure Horn characterization","depends_on":["[[27-df-purehorn]]","[[27-df-hornfunc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-hornpurechar"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-hornpurechar</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hornpurechar — Pure Horn characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a42b2c2b11efeb04\" href=\"?note=a42b2c2b11efeb04\" title=\"27-df-purehorn\">27-df-purehorn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol1^{(n)}=(1)_{i\\in[n]}\">\\(\\boldsymbol1^{(n)}=(1)_{i\\in[n]}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\)</span> are defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a42b2c2b11efeb04\" href=\"?note=a42b2c2b11efeb04\" title=\"27-df-purehorn\">27-df-purehorn</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;(f\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;(f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\land f(\\boldsymbol1^{(n)})=0)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;(f\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;(f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\land f(\\boldsymbol1^{(n)})=0)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.1, Theorem 6.3，印刷页 272，PDF 第 296 页（从 1 计数）。 已核对完整证明：pure Horn 项在 all-one 点为零；反向若 Horn DNF 的析取在 all-one 点为零，它不可能含任何全正项。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-purehorn","status":"resolved","id":"a42b2c2b11efeb04","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-purehorn]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornfunc","status":"resolved","id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-hornfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-purehorn","status":"resolved","id":"a42b2c2b11efeb04","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\boldsymbol1^{(n)}=(1)_{i\\in[n]}$; $\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$ and $\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-purehorn]] and [[27-df-hornfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornfunc","status":"resolved","id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\boldsymbol1^{(n)}=(1)_{i\\in[n]}$; $\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$ and $\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-purehorn]] and [[27-df-hornfunc]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol1^{(n)}=(1)_{i\\in[n]}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;(f\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;(f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\land f(\\boldsymbol1^{(n)})=0)).","display":true}],"bytes":1056,"backlinks":[{"id":"866e5085ffe52570","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-442","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-hornpurechar|thm-hornpurechar — Pure Horn characterization]]"},{"id":"109f4d56499c2ceb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["a42b2c2b11efeb04","bb96ce122f7cd0ef","5d10aed668d85817"]}